      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "YuumiQ",
        "name": "Prowling Projectile",
        "maxRank": 6,
        "summary": "Yuumi fires a missile, dealing damage and slowing first target hit. It deals bonus damage and an enchanced slow if it takes at least 1.35 seconds to get to its target. While on her Best Friend, the slow is always enhanced and grants bonus On-Hit damage to her ally.<br><br>While Attached, the missile can be controlled with your cursor for a brief period.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yuumi summons an errant missile that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200/235 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the first enemy and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> the target for 20%.<br /><br />If cast while <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attached</span>, Yuumi can control the missile using her mouse for a short period before it accelerates in a straight line. The accelerated missile deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/135/190/245/300/355 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> the target for 50/53/56/59/62/65% for 2 seconds, instead.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Best Friend Bonus:</span> <span>Prowling Projectile's</span> <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> will always be enhanced and hitting an enemy champion also grants them <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/12/14/16/18/20 + (5% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The bonus On-Hit damage can be increased by 75% based her ally's Critical Strike Chance.</span>",
        "iconFile": "YuumiQ.png",
