        "id": "YuumiE",
        "name": "Zoomies",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Shields Yuumi and boosts Move Speed and Attack Speed. If she's attached, she passes it to her ally instead.<br>",
        "bodyHtml": "Yuumi shields herself, blocking <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(65/90/115/140/165 + (40% Ability Power)) damage</span> and gains <span>(25/27.5/30/32.5/35 + (8% Ability Power))Attack Speed</span> for 3 seconds. While the shield persists, the target also gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20% Move Speed</span>.<br /><br />If Yuumi is <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attached</span>, this Ability affects her ally instead and also restores <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">20/24/28/32/36 Mana</span> to them, increased by up to 100% based on the target's missing Mana.",
