      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "YuumiR",
        "name": "Final Chapter",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Yuumi channels five waves that damage enemies and heal allies. Yuumi can move, attach, and cast Zoomies! while channeling. While on her Best Friend, this spell also follows her mouse.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yuumi channels for 3.5 seconds, launching 5 magical waves affecting both teams. If initially cast while <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attached</span>, Yuumi can steer the waves to follow her mouse.<br /><br />Enemies struck are dealt <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/125/175 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 10% for 1.25 seconds, increased by 10% per wave hit.<br /><br />Ally champions are healed for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(30/50/70 + (12% Ability Power)) health</span> per wave. Excess healing is converted to a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span> instead.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Best Friend Bonus:</span> For her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Best Friend</span>, the heal is increased to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(30/50/70 + (12% Ability Power)) health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Casting <span>You and Me!</span> will locks the waves in the current direction.<br />Yuumi can move and cast <span>Zoomies</span> while channeling.</span><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Missiles after the first deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(18.75/31.25/43.75 + (6.25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Max possible damage to a single enemy is <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.</span>",
        "iconFile": "YuumiR.png",
